  "description": "Floor mats are made from an automotive-grade hard-wearing rubberized polymer material for ultimate durability and lifelong use. Great products to protect your auto floor carpets from mud, salt, oil, water, and any dirt by covering them perfectly.\nFeatures\nPerfect fit. With advanced 3D laser scanning technology, the OEDRO front and rear floor mats are compatible with the 2014-2021 Toyota Tundra Double Cab / Crew Max Cab.\nAll-weather protection. OEDRO floor mats are made of TPE material, which can fully protect the vehicle's interior carpet from rain, fog, snow, liquid, debris, and other dirt.\nMaximum Carpet Protection. Ridges and channels keep your feet above the muck and direct liquid to the raised perimeter that extends up the walls of the footwell and acts as a shallow pan to ensure no liquid runs over onto your carpet.\nAdvanced Measuring System and Computer Design. The floor on each vehicle is digitally mapped using 3D laser equipment to obtain precise dimensions, then the molds that form the floor mats are computer designed, ensuring a finished product that hugs the contours of the floor.\nTPE Construction. OEDRO floor mats are made of TPE. This material is strong and durable, yet flexible even in extreme cold, as well as non-toxic, fire-resistant, UV-resistant, environmentally friendly, and odorless, so your interior won’t take on an unpleasant smell.\n2 years warranty. For your safety, professional installation is highly recommended.\nFitment\nFits for 2014-2021 Toyota Tundra Double / CrewMax Cab (Don't fit the 2nd Row with the under seat Storage).",
  "highlights": [
    "Premium Interior Protection: OEDRO Floor mats trap dirt, debris, and liquids to keep your vehicle floor clean and protected.",
    "Secure Driving Confidence: Anti-slip texture keeps mats firmly in place, helping ensure a safer and more stable ride.",
    "Built to Last: Durable, recyclable Thermoplastic Elastomer construction delivers long-term protection with easy maintenance."
  ],
